deo class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555950/extras/de1141745e15a57bbbf341dfad0b82cf.poster.avif?t=1780277068\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555950/extras/de1141745e15a57bbbf341dfad0b82cf.webm?t=1780277068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555950/extras/de1141745e15a57bbbf341dfad0b82cf.mp4?t=1780277068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Creative with Weapon Crafting</h2>Moma can craft two pieces of equipment by combining different types of blocks.<br><br>Some blocks can be upgraded by being placed with others of the same type. Use them wisely to craft any weapon, from long-range guns to sturdy shields.<br><br>Ultimately, your creativity is what will give you the upper hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555950/extras/5f6a0e288cb007261c042934a97e5ae1.poster.avif?t=1780277068\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555950/extras/5f6a0e288cb007261c042934a97e5ae1.webm?t=1780277068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555950/extras/5f6a0e288cb007261c042934a97e5ae1.mp4?t=1780277068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Barter with Shopkeepers</h2>Throughout Moma's journey, she will encounter several shopkeepers offering crafting blocks, items, and relics that can enhance her abilities.<br><br>However, shops in Million Depth don't take traditional payment. Barter with the shopkeepers while keeping a keen eye on the value of your offer and the shopkeepers' mood to get the best deal possible. If it goes well, they might offer you valuable items at bargain prices, but if you get too greedy, you risk upsetting the shopkeeper, who might hike the prices in response.<br><br>What's more, the underground world is also home to a strange resource called Stockinum, the value of which fluctuates constantly...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555950/extras/4deae04bcfcdd89e1aa47d9be471efc0.poster.avif?t=1780277068\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555950/extras/4deae04bcfcdd89e1aa47d9be471efc0.webm?t=1780277068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555950/extras/4deae04bcfcdd89e1aa47d9be471efc0.mp4?t=1780277068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
